<title>USA: Perrigo Co Q3 March 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Perrigo Co Q3 March 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ALLEGAN, Mich. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.15		    $0.14</p>
<p> Net			 11,600		   10,634</p>
<p> Revs		     214,580		  196,326</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  77,387		   77,215</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1997 results after $2,215,000 in restructuring costs, vs $263,000 a year ago, and after $1,503,000 in unusual litigation costs, vs $1,586,000. Excluding items, Q3 1997 net income $0.18 vs $0.15.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.47		    $0.45</p>
<p> Net			 36,008		   34,986</p>
<p> Revs		     648,419		  602,464</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  77,262		   77,205</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1997 results after $4,577,000 in restructuring costs vs $1,878,000 a year ago, and after $4,799,000 in unusual litigation costs vs $4,584,000.</p>
<p>Excluding items, nine-month 1997 earnings were $0.54 vs $0.51.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
